# Never send secrets, host-built dependencies or build output into the image.
# (at every depth: e.g. apps/web/.env.local would bake NEXT_PUBLIC_* values into the build)
**/.env
**/.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.production.example
**/node_modules
# The local embedded-Postgres data (dev data and password hashes) must never ship.
.pgdata
**/.pgdata
data
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/*.log
.git
.github
docs
tests
*.md
.gitignore
.claude
.qa
coverage
Dockerfile
docker-compose*.yml
